      <activity id="416d3f25-370a-5abf-9f6b-02c59e997fc7" activityNameId="e41990ea-29d0-5dd2-819f-f86c5db9e910" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, production from CHP natural gas, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, production from CHP natural gas, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: e7a1f436-1b51-38dd-b1db-f10d64df0983
Included are the electricity production in 0, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 60 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e7a1f436-1b51-38dd-b1db-f10d64df0983.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
